{
    desc => q{N repeats search in opposite direction (backward after forward)},
    description => <<'END_DESC',
## Macro: `xt/visual/macros/search_N_backward`

**N** repeats the last search in the opposite direction. After `/alpha` finds the first match, `N` goes backward to find the previous match (wrapping around).

**Keys:** `/alpha\n` then `N`

**initial.png**
- Cursor at line 1, col 0
- Three "alpha" occurrences on the line

**after_forward_search.png**
- Cursor on first "alpha" at col 0

**after_N.png**
- Cursor wrapped backward to last "alpha" at col 23
- `N` searched backward from the first match, wrapping to end of line
END_DESC
    run => sub {
        my ($ctx) = @_;
        $ctx->buffer->set_text($CODE);
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('initial');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->keys('/alpha\n');
        $ctx->delay(300);
        $ctx->snapshot('after_forward_search');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->keys('N');
        $ctx->delay(200);
        $ctx->snapshot('after_N');
    },
}
